WEBVTT

00:02.964 --> 00:05.264
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:05.404 --> 00:08.424
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:08.934 --> 00:11.674
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:11.674 --> 00:16.304
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:16.744 --> 00:23.704
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:25.454 --> 00:28.324
Dragon Drive

00:28.324 --> 00:33.824
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:33.964 --> 00:36.934
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:36.934 --> 00:40.164
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:40.674 --> 00:45.044
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:45.044 --> 00:47.014
ima mo
I'd still...

00:47.014 --> 00:53.314
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:55.054 --> 00:57.424
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:57.424 --> 01:00.614
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

01:00.954 --> 01:05.964
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:05.964 --> 01:07.524
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:07.664 --> 01:10.064
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:10.064 --> 01:13.194
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:13.604 --> 01:18.674
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:18.674 --> 01:21.414
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:21.414 --> 01:29.074
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:44.204 --> 01:46.294
Something's coming. Be ready!

01:55.844 --> 01:57.334
He's only a child!

01:59.614 --> 02:01.984
Well, well. I understand now.

02:02.554 --> 02:03.174
Watch out!

02:09.954 --> 02:10.894
Hideaki!

02:24.874 --> 02:27.204
Where is the Shrine located?

02:32.144 --> 02:33.444
This can't be!

02:33.514 --> 02:35.544
Hideaki, are you?

02:37.384 --> 02:40.754
Betrayal

02:55.104 --> 02:58.764
Hideaki, are you one of
Kouhei Toki's fighters?!

03:01.844 --> 03:03.434
Th-This can't be.

03:06.314 --> 03:08.614
Don't look at me like that.

03:08.984 --> 03:10.954
I'm the strongest warrior around.

03:12.524 --> 03:15.254
You like strong people, don't you?

03:16.294 --> 03:19.224
Hideaki. Who are you?

03:33.914 --> 03:34.874
Damn.

03:34.944 --> 03:37.374
Where in the world
did Kouhei and the others go?

03:41.114 --> 03:43.314
Hey! Where did those guys go?!

03:43.384 --> 03:45.044
We've lost sight of them!

03:45.124 --> 03:46.454
Oww...

03:48.724 --> 03:51.454
Guys, Chibi says they went this way!
Let's go!

03:51.764 --> 03:52.984
Hey, Reiji!

03:53.064 --> 03:54.684
Are you sure it's that way?!

03:54.894 --> 03:56.494
Don't worry!

03:56.964 --> 03:58.994
Chibi can tell where they are.

03:59.204 --> 04:00.934
We'll be sure to catch up to them.

04:01.404 --> 04:04.164
Rockaku, are you all right
with your injuries?

04:04.604 --> 04:06.664
You should go back and get them treated.

04:06.744 --> 04:08.644
You've gotta be kidding!

04:08.744 --> 04:10.944
I'm not about to have minor injuries
like these affect me!

04:11.144 --> 04:13.474
You're in that much pain from just talking.

04:13.684 --> 04:15.314
You're pushing yourself way too much.

04:15.384 --> 04:16.514
He's right.

04:16.684 --> 04:17.844
Hey, Thundervolt!

04:18.084 --> 04:19.674
Do Rockaku a favor and take him back!

04:19.784 --> 04:20.944
Wh-What?!

04:25.724 --> 04:28.164
H-Hey, stop it, Thundervolt!

04:28.334 --> 04:30.294
Why aren't you doing as I say?!

04:30.404 --> 04:31.994
Hey!

04:32.934 --> 04:35.594
Hey!! Thundervolt! Come on!

04:37.174 --> 04:38.694
Way to go, Thundervolt!

04:38.804 --> 04:40.034
Let's go, Daisuke!

04:40.104 --> 04:40.904
Right!

04:57.394 --> 05:00.824
Yo. Job well done.
We've been waiting for you.

05:02.864 --> 05:05.834
Hi. How've you been, Meguru?!

05:16.944 --> 05:18.704
You're Kouhei Toki, aren't you?

05:20.044 --> 05:21.174
Let me tell you something.

05:21.254 --> 05:25.414
You're younger than me, so you gotta
show some respect and call me "Mister"!

05:26.454 --> 05:27.584
Mister?!

05:28.894 --> 05:31.624
I'm Mister Kouhei Toki to you!

05:31.694 --> 05:33.784
The man over there is Mister Mahiru!

05:33.994 --> 05:35.124
Remember that!

05:43.134 --> 05:45.264
So, what's your name?

05:45.974 --> 05:46.944
Hideaki.

05:47.474 --> 05:50.934
Hideaki? Sounds kinda stuffy.

05:53.754 --> 05:54.614
Hey!

05:54.684 --> 05:57.814
Looks like you walked right into his trap.

05:58.654 --> 05:59.784
Trap?

06:01.294 --> 06:03.524
Did you damage that dam yourself
in order to trick us?

06:06.724 --> 06:07.784
Hideaki!

06:08.164 --> 06:09.024
Meguru!

06:09.434 --> 06:11.864
Rest assured. We're here to help.

06:11.964 --> 06:14.304
An evil dragon came and broke the mountain!

06:17.244 --> 06:19.764
By "evil dragon", I was referring to myself.

06:20.004 --> 06:25.074
So you purposely put that town at risk
just so you could fool me?!

06:26.284 --> 06:31.014
It's all because you said you like me,
yet you wouldn't trust me.

06:32.054 --> 06:36.084
Besides, I was taught to do
whatever it takes to reach my objectives.

06:37.224 --> 06:40.424
Is that RI-ON?! Did they teach you that idea?!

06:41.494 --> 06:44.834
Since when has RI-ON stooped so low
as to brainwash children like him?

06:45.104 --> 06:47.224
I find that unbelievable, even for RI-ON.

06:47.634 --> 06:50.604
He wasn't brainwashed...
this kid's different.

06:50.874 --> 06:53.234
Also, age is irrelevant in games.

06:53.844 --> 06:56.334
The stronger will always find a way to win.

06:56.844 --> 06:58.044
That's all.

07:05.124 --> 07:09.754
Now, will you tell us
where we'll find the real Dragonite?!

07:10.094 --> 07:11.684
- She told me.
- What?

07:12.894 --> 07:14.824
It's in the Shrine
of the Four Sacred Dragons.

07:17.664 --> 07:20.364
And the Shrine of the Four Sacred Dragons
is found in the Dragons' Graveyard...

07:20.434 --> 07:22.634
...in the wilderness to the east.

07:22.774 --> 07:24.034
Dragons' Graveyard?

07:24.104 --> 07:25.834
I've heard about such a place.

07:26.974 --> 07:30.074
I understand it's an incredibly fearful place.

07:31.184 --> 07:33.704
I see. The Dragon's Graveyard.

07:34.384 --> 07:36.114
You did well, Hideaki.

07:36.784 --> 07:38.914
Meguru is very fond of me.

07:40.054 --> 07:41.584
That's why I brought her here.

07:43.594 --> 07:45.064
I have no problem with that.

07:45.224 --> 07:47.214
We need a guide to lead us there anyway.

07:48.294 --> 07:50.564
As someone who's been in Rikyu
longer than me, I'm counting on you.

07:51.004 --> 07:53.564
You don't seriously think
I'll take orders from you, do you?!

07:54.474 --> 07:58.064
If you won't help voluntarily,
we'll just hafta force you.

08:07.614 --> 08:08.774
Meguru!

08:09.284 --> 08:11.914
We didn't even hafta go and find him,
he's come to us.

08:12.184 --> 08:14.244
He makes things so easy for us!

08:14.694 --> 08:17.254
Hideaki! Capture him!

08:18.094 --> 08:18.754
What about Meguru?

08:19.464 --> 08:21.434
We'll watch over her.

08:25.804 --> 08:27.734
Sit back and watch my power.

08:31.144 --> 08:34.004
Too bad such a troublesome guy
like him loves you so much.

08:42.054 --> 08:43.014
Hideaki!

08:43.114 --> 08:45.144
So you did come from RI-ON, after all!

08:45.454 --> 08:47.184
What do you plan to do with Meguru?!

08:48.954 --> 08:50.754
Meguru belongs to me.

08:51.664 --> 08:53.064
I won't let anyone have her!

08:58.534 --> 09:01.124
I'm really strong, you know!

09:02.234 --> 09:04.674
I'm the strongest warrior RI-ON has!

09:06.044 --> 09:08.674
I used to be a Dragon Drive
Champion myself!

09:08.844 --> 09:11.314
You won't defeat me that easily!

09:32.164 --> 09:33.154
Ichirou!

09:54.624 --> 09:57.654
Well? Hideaki, was it?

09:57.894 --> 09:59.554
How's he doing?

09:59.624 --> 10:00.594
Okay, I think.

10:01.494 --> 10:03.464
We know that he safely arrived...

10:03.834 --> 10:06.424
...and has established contact with Kouhei.

10:07.604 --> 10:09.934
Can we retrieve information from him?

10:10.544 --> 10:13.334
We've used the latest technology
to get him there...

10:13.844 --> 10:17.474
...so we can get a basic understanding
of what's going on, but nothing too specific.

10:18.114 --> 10:21.674
For example, Hideaki's Crystal Gene
is presently fighting against...

10:23.614 --> 10:25.174
Hayate Slash, from the looks of it.

10:25.524 --> 10:26.884
Hayate Slash?

10:27.124 --> 10:29.214
Then he's fighting
against Ichirou Sumishiba.

10:29.324 --> 10:30.294
Probably.

10:30.924 --> 10:34.224
That wouldn't have been the case
if Ichirou hadn't betrayed RI-ON.

10:35.164 --> 10:38.394
From the way things look, Hideaki
will make easy work of Ichirou.

10:41.004 --> 10:43.564
Please. Go and search for Meguru!

10:43.904 --> 10:44.874
But...

10:45.474 --> 10:46.904
I know.

10:47.074 --> 10:51.034
But she's my one and only sister.

10:52.514 --> 10:54.574
Should anything happen to Ichirou...

10:55.414 --> 10:56.404
What's wrong?

10:58.854 --> 10:59.984
N-Nothing.

11:00.054 --> 11:04.784
Are we able to give Hideaki
directions from here?

11:05.594 --> 11:07.084
No, we can't.

11:07.594 --> 11:09.924
We only gave him basic orders
based on the overall plan.

11:10.194 --> 11:13.104
We gave him room
to be flexible and independent.

11:13.704 --> 11:15.104
But we can bring him back, right?

11:15.374 --> 11:16.334
Yes.

11:16.774 --> 11:20.104
But if we did such a thing too suddenly,
he could blow up.

11:21.774 --> 11:22.934
What's wrong?

11:23.314 --> 11:24.674
The situation has changed.

11:25.214 --> 11:26.774
The number of enemies has increased.

11:34.494 --> 11:37.014
Are you all right, Ichirou?!

11:37.564 --> 11:39.224
This is where his age really shows.

11:39.294 --> 11:41.194
He's gotta force the enemy into a checkmate.

11:41.294 --> 11:44.094
If it were me, I would've caught
and taken care of him long ago.

11:50.374 --> 11:52.774
So that boy was an enemy, after all.

11:52.944 --> 11:54.734
I can't believe that kid!

11:54.874 --> 11:55.844
Ichirou!

11:55.944 --> 11:57.744
I guess you were right all along!

11:58.114 --> 12:00.484
I think it's a little late to apologize now!

12:00.784 --> 12:01.754
Hideaki!

12:02.314 --> 12:04.344
You were tricking us all along?!

12:04.554 --> 12:05.884
You lied to us?!

12:06.354 --> 12:07.484
It was all strategy.

12:07.554 --> 12:09.994
It's to be expected in a battle.

12:10.294 --> 12:13.054
And you're okay with that?!

12:13.364 --> 12:15.994
You talk as if you know everything,
but you know what?

12:16.094 --> 12:19.494
The worst kind of human being
is one who betrays others!

12:20.234 --> 12:24.004
I have no idea what you're getting at.

12:24.174 --> 12:25.104
What?!

12:25.174 --> 12:26.474
Stop it, Reiji!

12:26.544 --> 12:28.304
Stubborn kids like this...

12:28.374 --> 12:31.244
...need to be taught a painful lesson
to get the message!

12:31.314 --> 12:32.644
I agree!

12:32.714 --> 12:35.704
We must get him back on the right track
through battle!

12:36.854 --> 12:37.814
Hey.

12:38.054 --> 12:40.074
If we're gonna fight, let's fight.

12:40.484 --> 12:42.354
We don't need you to tell us!

12:42.594 --> 12:44.024
Here we come!

12:59.144 --> 13:01.434
Are you sure you don't wanna
tell me where it is?

13:05.544 --> 13:09.504
If you tell me, we can call off
this unnecessary fight.

13:09.754 --> 13:11.724
I guess it can't be helped.

13:11.924 --> 13:13.324
You're coming with me!

13:43.214 --> 13:44.684
Okay, here I come!

13:44.854 --> 13:46.214
Say your prayers!

13:57.164 --> 13:59.564
This is for what you did earlier!

14:00.604 --> 14:02.034
What?! He dodged it!

14:19.454 --> 14:20.714
I don't see Rockaku.

14:20.794 --> 14:21.754
Mahiru!

14:21.824 --> 14:25.484
Sit back and watch
as we get rid of these weaklings!

14:25.824 --> 14:28.054
If it's okay with you, I think I'll do that.

14:28.134 --> 14:31.624
You're the guy who's always
going after Rockaku, aren't you?!

14:33.504 --> 14:35.434
It's tough to be popular, isn't it?

14:35.504 --> 14:37.634
You could kill time by being his opponent.

14:37.844 --> 14:38.734
Yes, sir.

14:39.444 --> 14:41.804
I've had enough of your trash talk!

14:58.524 --> 15:00.294
Stay alert, Chibi!

15:04.264 --> 15:05.594
Meguru!

15:21.254 --> 15:22.514
Are you all right, Ichirou?!

15:22.584 --> 15:25.244
Yeah. But more importantly,
please go and save Meguru!

15:25.424 --> 15:27.754
I know! We'll work together to get her back!

15:27.824 --> 15:28.794
Right!

15:31.424 --> 15:33.554
It's becoming a melee out there.

15:34.464 --> 15:35.434
Meguru.

15:35.934 --> 15:37.994
Are you there with them?

15:38.064 --> 15:40.554
What's going on, Meguru?!

15:51.814 --> 15:53.474
I'm getting bored.

15:53.614 --> 15:56.714
Hey! Are you serious about not telling me...

15:56.784 --> 15:58.014
...where the Shrine of the Four
Sacred Dragons is?

16:00.084 --> 16:02.644
Darn. How can you be so stubborn?

16:03.024 --> 16:06.724
Well, if that's how you're gonna behave,
then I'll hafta play rough.

16:06.824 --> 16:08.764
Don't complain to me if someone dies.

16:09.864 --> 16:11.494
No one's gonna die!

16:11.704 --> 16:13.754
If someone must sacrifice
his or her life, then...

16:15.104 --> 16:18.034
I wonder how much longer
you'll keep up your bluff.

16:28.514 --> 16:29.444
Ichirou!

16:30.054 --> 16:31.484
Ichirou!

16:31.624 --> 16:33.954
I hate to say this, but playtime is over!

16:34.454 --> 16:38.414
I'll show you how meaningless
your so-called "friendship power" is!

16:41.734 --> 16:43.354
Goodbye, Ichirou!

16:49.704 --> 16:51.634
I've had enough of you!

16:51.704 --> 16:54.304
I'm not about to let you
have everything your way!

16:55.814 --> 16:57.544
You're in way over your head, girl!

16:57.614 --> 16:59.944
- I'm gonna beat you down to size!
- Stop it!!

17:02.314 --> 17:04.684
You've made it clear
that you're dead serious.

17:04.754 --> 17:05.774
However...

17:06.684 --> 17:08.214
So am I.

17:20.034 --> 17:21.294
This is crazy!

17:28.014 --> 17:29.874
Meguru!

17:32.584 --> 17:35.744
Give Meguru back to me!

17:37.054 --> 17:39.144
What's that? The color changed.

17:39.484 --> 17:41.474
Yeah. It's a sign of anger.

17:41.924 --> 17:44.154
He's persistently chasing another dragon.

17:44.424 --> 17:45.984
The dragon being chased is...

17:46.764 --> 17:48.254
...Hayate Slash.

17:48.664 --> 17:50.754
It looks like he's going for the kill this time!

17:54.634 --> 17:56.334
Yes. This is Agent S speaking.

17:56.934 --> 17:57.874
What?

17:57.944 --> 17:58.994
Are you sure?

18:00.104 --> 18:01.474
All right, I'll be right there!

18:03.044 --> 18:05.674
They say there's some kind of malfunction
in the training center.

18:05.744 --> 18:07.014
I'll go and see what's wrong.

18:07.084 --> 18:08.044
Okay.

18:40.344 --> 18:42.974
Hurry! Escape to some place safe!

18:43.154 --> 18:43.944
But...

18:44.014 --> 18:45.644
I made a promise with L!

18:45.954 --> 18:47.754
I promised that I'd protect you!

18:47.954 --> 18:49.714
So I'm not letting him have you!

18:54.294 --> 18:56.284
Give Meguru back to me!

18:57.564 --> 18:59.194
Meguru doesn't belong to you!

18:59.704 --> 19:01.694
If you won't return her...

19:01.774 --> 19:03.064
...I won't forgive you!

19:05.904 --> 19:07.394
Ichirou!

19:07.544 --> 19:08.774
Chibi, let's do it!

19:09.244 --> 19:12.004
SinnSaber!

19:33.204 --> 19:35.674
What's wrong, Reiji?! Why won't you fire?!

19:35.734 --> 19:38.504
I can't! I haven't mastered the aim yet!

19:38.744 --> 19:41.264
If I'm even slightly off, I could hit Ichirou!

19:57.824 --> 19:59.554
Give Meguru back to me!

19:59.894 --> 20:01.884
Do it, Hideaki! Get him!

20:02.294 --> 20:04.124
Stop it, Hideaki!

20:06.504 --> 20:08.264
What are you waiting for?! Finish him!

20:09.234 --> 20:10.134
Hideaki!

20:13.444 --> 20:14.804
What did you do?

20:17.414 --> 20:19.074
I-I did nothing.

20:34.734 --> 20:35.854
Hideaki!

20:39.564 --> 20:40.694
Meguru...

20:43.734 --> 20:45.734
Wh-Why, that's...

20:45.974 --> 20:47.704
These measures are necessary
for RI-ON's sake.

20:54.144 --> 20:54.944
Hideaki?!

20:55.554 --> 20:56.844
Shut up!

20:59.184 --> 21:02.384
N-Never mind about me!

21:05.594 --> 21:06.954
Mr. Kouhei. Let's go.

21:08.094 --> 21:10.184
This is no time to be playing around here!

21:10.264 --> 21:12.234
Let's go to the Dragons' Graveyard!

21:12.464 --> 21:14.564
You've got some nerve to give me orders!

21:14.974 --> 21:16.874
I'm not the one giving orders!

21:17.074 --> 21:18.534
Father's telling us to go!

21:18.674 --> 21:19.734
Let's hurry!

21:20.004 --> 21:22.204
Hey! Where do you think you're going?!

21:22.274 --> 21:23.244
Reiji!

21:24.314 --> 21:26.804
They still don't know the exact way there.

21:27.014 --> 21:30.474
So they won't be arriving at the Shrine
of the Four Sacred Dragons right away.

21:30.614 --> 21:33.554
The wise thing for us to do is to regroup!

21:35.754 --> 21:36.884
Damn those guys.

21:57.444 --> 22:00.104
taikutsu datta
I was bored

22:00.184 --> 22:02.874
okubyou datta
I was a coward

22:02.954 --> 22:06.884
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:08.354 --> 22:11.054
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:11.124 --> 22:13.284
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:13.764 --> 22:17.854
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:19.304 --> 22:21.894
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:21.974 --> 22:24.634
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:24.704 --> 22:28.664
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:30.014 --> 22:32.444
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:32.514 --> 22:35.444
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:35.514 --> 22:40.384
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:41.054 --> 22:43.714
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:43.794 --> 22:46.484
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:46.564 --> 22:51.194
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
Take us to an endless dream

22:51.934 --> 22:54.624
hon no chiisana yasashisa ga
Only a small kindness

22:54.704 --> 22:57.294
hon no wazuka na sasayaki ga
Only a small whisper

22:57.374 --> 23:02.004
futari wo sotto tsutsunde kureru
Wrap us gently

23:02.674 --> 23:07.174
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:08.114 --> 23:13.784
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:16.354 --> 23:18.914
Next time

23:19.364 --> 23:21.324
Boy, that was close!

23:21.434 --> 23:24.094
They almost succeeded
in taking Meguru with them!

23:24.564 --> 23:27.364
The next thing for us to do is go to
the Shrine of the Four Sacred Dragons...

23:27.434 --> 23:29.764
...and protect the Dragonite
from Kouhei and the others!

23:29.834 --> 23:31.534
- Nowhere! Nowhere!
- What?!

23:31.604 --> 23:33.544
The Shrine's nowhere to be found?!

23:33.604 --> 23:36.704
Y-Y-You mean we're lost?!

23:36.774 --> 23:38.004
Lost!

23:38.084 --> 23:40.414
